assert volume_cone(10, 15) == 1570.7963267948965
assert volume_cone(19, 17) == 6426.651371693521

print("All tests passed!")

This function `volume_cone` calculates the volume of a cone using the formula:

\[ V = \frac{1}{3} \pi r^2 h \]

where \( r \) is the radius of the base and \( h \) is the height of the cone. The test cases provided are used to verify the correctness of the function.
