You are an expert Python programmer, and here is your task: Write a python function to set the left most unset bit. Your code should pass these tests:

assert set_left_most_unset_bit(10) == 14
assert set_left_most_unset_bit(12) == 14
assert set_left_most_unset_bit(15) == 15
[BEGIN]

answer:  def set_left_most_unset_bit(n):
    # Find the leftmost unset bit
    while n > 0:
        if n & 1 == 0:
            n >>= 1
        else:
            break
    
    # Set the leftmost unset bit
    n |= 1
    
    return n

# Test cases
assert set_left_most_unset_bit(10) == 14
assert set_left_most_unset_bit(12) == 14
assert set_left_most_unset_bit(15) == 15

print("All tests passed!")


